(PCOSINA THESIS APPENDIX: AUTH, ONBOARDING, AND DATA INTEGRITY) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(**Scope**) Tj
0 -12 Td
(This appendix documents the end-to-end auth/onboarding/data flow analysis, formal behavioral specifications, and engineering fixes for PCOSINA. It is written to be demo-ready and thesis-defensible.) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(A\) Diagnosis \(Root Causes + Locations\)) Tj
0 -12 Td
(1. Validation gaps in auth) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Root cause: Email format and password complexity not enforced before Firebase calls.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Components: AuthViewModel.onLogin, AuthViewModel.onSignUp.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Files: app/src/main/java/com/pcosina/app/ui/AuthViewModel.kt.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. Onboarding resets after relogin) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Root cause: Routing decisions made before profile load completes; stale or default profile used.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Components: AppNavHost login route; UserViewModel load timing.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Files: app/src/main/java/com/pcosina/app/ui/navigation/AppNavHost.kt.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. Cross-account plan and grocery leakage) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Root cause: Email-keyed DataStore and in-memory caches not cleared on logout.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Components: UserPreferencesRepository keys; MealPlanViewModel; GroceryViewModel.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Files: app/src/main/java/com/pcosina/app/data/repository/UserPreferencesRepository.kt, app/src/main/java/com/pcosina/app/ui/MealPlanViewModel.kt, app/src/main/java/com/pcosina/app/ui/GroceryViewModel.kt.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(4. Identity drift risk) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Root cause: Email is mutable; storage keyed by email breaks when email changes.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Components: UserPreferencesRepository key strategy.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Files: app/src/main/java/com/pcosina/app/data/repository/UserPreferencesRepository.kt.) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(B\) Correct Behavior Spec \(Formal Rules\)) Tj
0 -12 Td
(1. Signup/Login validation) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Email required and valid format.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Password required, length >= 8, at least 1 letter, 1 number, 1 special character.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Confirm password must match.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Invalid input must not call Firebase; show inline error.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. onboardingComplete/profileCompleted persistence) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Profile completion is per-account and stored by UID.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Routing must wait for profile load before deciding destination.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. Logout behavior) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Must sign out Firebase.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Must clear session and reset in-memory caches.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Must not delete user data unless explicitly requested.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(4. Per-account isolation) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - All persisted data is UID-keyed.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - No read/write when UID missing.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(   - Reset in-memory caches on UID change.) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(C\) Fix Plan \(Ordered, Minimal Risk\)) Tj
0 -12 Td
(1. Enforce auth validation rules in AuthViewModel.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. Reset UserViewModel, MealPlanViewModel, GroceryViewModel on logout.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. Route to Splash after login and wait for profile load to decide Dashboard vs Onboarding.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(4. Switch DataStore keys from email to UID.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(5. Migrate legacy email-keyed data to UID once.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(6. Invalidate in-memory caches on UID change.) Tj
0 -12 Td
() Tj
0 -12 Td
(D\) Improvements & Enhancements) Tj
0 -12 Td
(### Demo polish \(high-impact, low-effort\)) Tj
0 -12 Td
(1. Inline field validation and helpful hints for onboarding.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. Numeric input masks for age, weight, height, budget.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. Disable Next until required fields are valid.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(4. Loading overlay during profile restoration after login.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(5. Offline error banner for plan generation.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(6. Show plan timestamp on plan screen.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(7. Explain why each profile field is required.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(8. Distinct errors for auth vs network failures.) Tj
